  "name": "kiss3d",
  "description": "A minimalist real-time 3D graphics engine for Rust designed for rapid prototyping and scientific visualization via a high-level, 'one-liner' API. It abstracts low-level OpenGL complexities by providing a simplified scene graph, automated resource management for shaders and textures, and built-in support for interactive cameras and common geometric primitives.",
